0a58abe843aa","cmd-0a4cd91664ba4615","global:after_executor:node1:failed-services","global:after_executor:node1:listening-sockets","global:after_executor:node1:package-health"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied. The mandatory node-restart protocol is also complete: a healthy baseline and boot ID were captured, the restart was acknowledged and observed, the boot ID changed, and the node recovered with the lock, package state, SSH, RPM database, and system health intact. Fixed lifecycle boot observations independently confirm the restart.","limitations":["A full 269-package system upgrade was not executed; it was checked with an aborted preview. However, a real targeted curl upgrade, the active global version lock, the preview’s omission of curl, and the unlocked negative control provide strong direct evidence that curl is held.","Lifecycle snapshots are bounded and do not inventory the version-lock configuration or installed plugin packages; those states are instead established by direct executor commands."]}
